 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Send out a mass email, invite the couple to add their guests from there, and say the invitation goes out few months before. Let her know it's for the couple and their guests, and that she doesn't need to wear something special. You can even say she's welcome to wear anything she feels comfortable in. Then gently remind her that the couple has invited their close friends and family, not the whole office. drinks are usually after the ceremony. You can say drinks will be after the honeymoon if you want. Just avoid saying they' be after the wedding, since that's bit odd.",
